1. The WCST Nethack Newsletter and Spoilers
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Greetings everybody, and happy hacking!  This is the second edition of the 
ill-fated WCST Nethack Newsletter.  It was originally going to be a monthly 
thing (when the first one came out a year ago), but I kind of got majorly 
bogged down in other things -- especially work in the real world.  (I know 
we'd all much rather just stay in our Nethack worlds, right?)

Anyways, Nethack version 3.1 is now officially out, and many many posts are 
flying all over the place about it, so I thought it would be good to "make my 
presence felt," as it were.  This edition of the WCST Nethack Newsletter 
contains several pieces of information.  First, it contains the new WCST 
e-mail and U.S. mail addresses.  Second, it contains information about what's 
going to be happening with the Spoilers.  Third, it contains a large section 
detailing a large number of things that have changed in version 3.1 of 
Nethack.

Incidentally, if you'd like to be placed on the WCST e-mailing list, please 
send me e-mail with your address.  I'll tack you onto the list and send you a 
reply back to verify that I can get through to you.

