3. Revision 8.00 of the Spoilers
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
We are busy at work on Revision 8.00 of the Spoilers.  Ken Roth, one of the 
original members of the spoiler team (kroth@wheaton.wheaton.edu) has once 
again joined forces with me so that we can get this new version of the 
Spoilers out in record time.

We hope to have at least a preliminary version available by the end of 
February or the middle of March, but don't shoot me if I'm wrong.  
Submissions or suggestions are always welcome.

Once again, we will be releasing both a public and a commercial version of 
the Spoilers.  The public version will contain all of the information 
contained in the commercial version, in straight ASCII text.  The commercial 
version will be desktop published and bound with considerable artwork, an 
excellent index, etc.  More information will be forthcoming when revision 
8.00 is ready to roll.

