6) The Quest:  One of the sub-plots in Nethack is a Quest.  In my case, since 
I play a (neutral) wizard, the Wizard of Balance asks me to seek out the Eye 
of Harmony from the Dark One.  The Quest levels are also called the Home 
levels.  They are reached by going through a magic portal from a random 
level.  You'll know when you hit the level with the magic portal because 
you'll get a message from your old Master (in my case, the Wizard of 
Balance).  There are several levels in the Quest, but the most important ones 
are as follows:

A) The Quest Start:  This is where you'll meet up with your old mentor and 
he'll tell you what you need to seek out.  An example level is shown below.
Several notes:  The ^ shown is the magic portal back to the main dungeon.  
The #'s aren't rock or passageways - they're mist, and they make seeing any 
quantity of the level quite a chore.  The @ shown is your Master.  There will 
