9) As befits the princes of the underworld, a couple of them now have special 
levels devoted to them.  In particular, Asmodeus and Baalzebub each have a 
special level.  Example levels are shown below.  A few notes about greater 
demons, though:  In 3.1, greater demons are incredibly nasty.  They're all 
really tough, really quick, really intelligent, and can teleport.  For the 
most part, this means that they will teleport in, attack you once or twice, 
and then teleport away from you.  Getting close enough to attack them, much 
less actually kill them, is quite a feat.  Those of you who used to have fun 
sacrificing humans as chaotic characters and then killing off the greater 
demons for the experience might want to think twice before trying it in 
version 3.1. 

